[{"client_msg_id":"b8a5924a-03ab-4324-8c65-af8bbd56a9a2","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"helpみると、has('vim9script')でできるようになるっぽいんですが、まだ有効じゃないんですよね。","ts":"1629526365.108200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"munen","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GUnq"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *vim9-mix*\nThere is one way to use both legacy and Vim9 syntax in one script file:  \n        \" comments may go here\n        if !has('vim9script')\n           \" legacy script commands go here\n           finish\n        endif\n        vim9script\n        # Vim9 script commands go here\nThis allows for writing a script that takes advantage of the Vim9 script\nsyntax if possible, but will also work on a Vim version without it.\n \nThis can only work in two ways:\n1. The \"if\" statement evaluates to false, the commands up to `endif` are\n   skipped and `vim9script` is then the first command actually executed.\n2. The \"if\" statement evaluates to true, the commands up to `endif` are\n   executed and `finish` bails out before reaching `vim9script`.\n \nTODO: The \"vim9script\" feature does not exist yet, it will only be added once\nthe Vim9 script syntax has been fully implemented.\n \n \nExport\n```","ts":"1629526329.107500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"0d7e22f6-4720-4830-8611-c69943c4df35","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":":h vim9-mix","ts":"1629526329.107400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tAo=B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41CA8C3C-B7DD-45A3-900A-D8B5D8141EC1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ほぉ","ts":"1629526225.107200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/A2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1cd493a-4bb5-4bc2-9508-e648286ad534","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"なるほど…","ts":"1629525937.107000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MOFy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef77f83f-9397-4a98-8883-0fb89597f951","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"```if !exists(':vim9script')\n\tfinish\nendif\nvim9script```\n私はこんな感じにしていますね。vim9 script","ts":"1629525924.106800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T26"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92357fb5-72eb-4d22-b548-1ebb4cd76b84","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"if も書けるのか…","ts":"1629525883.106200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1YQfY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa2c038e-30a4-42c9-ab98-4c3374a6cc72","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"はい。ただコメントや特定のif文は書ける","ts":"1629525867.105900","edited":{"user":"UBQ2H65JQ","ts":"1629525882.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9=7i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f15f41a6-d33f-45e8-bf29-a4e65bd9ab8e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"一応、ファイルの最初のコマンドでなくてないけない、と言う制約はあります","ts":"1629525832.105300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qPJP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12d8e7fc-942a-433b-a559-29310ff223f9","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"```vim9script```\nは1行にしか書けないくらいの制約があったほうが実はよかったりしそう","ts":"1629525805.104900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dF48"}]},{"client_msg_id":"38492545-c841-480a-82ef-c9a10ecc2179","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CLKR04BEF/p1629525524131900?thread_ts=1629386264.089200\u0026amp;cid=CLKR04BEF\u003e","ts":"162952